# SmartCampus MITS (Findora) - Environment Configuration

# 1. Google Gemini Flash AI (Optional - for semantic item matchmaking)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Gmail SMTP Configuration (To deliver real welcome emails to students' Gmail inboxes)
# Instructions to get a 16-character Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to Google Account (myaccount.google.com) -> Security -> 2-Step Verification.
# 2. At the bottom, click "App passwords".
# 3. Create an app named "Findora" and copy the 16-character password.
# 4. Fill in:
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
SMTP_FROM_NAME="Findora - SmartCampus MITS"

# 3. Alternative: Resend API (Recommended for Vercel Serverless - 3,000 free emails/mo)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_resend_api_key_here
